          "finding_details": "Raw running config SHA-256: 8ed0c9e3e59ab6fc8afc4e5e20d238df8b4935a3640646cb62cedeb5ef3f3654\nOfficial Cisco benchmark SHA-256: 8ee8f9c7792fcd12ad232e1a24b7206178257094a2bc4d64fc8dfd746e8e3b40\nRunning config alone does not verify this control's complete operational check; manual review required.",
